# Scenario 034 — Online platform trust & safety: governance, scoped Memory, reject, human decision
/reset
yes
/enterprise
1
Beacon Platform Trust
Moderate consistently and fairly, with a person accountable for every enforcement decision.
skip
/function
1
Policy Framing
Frame content-moderation questions into process and evidence needs for an accountable lead.
skip
/add-human-worker
Trust & Safety Lead
1
skip
/function start "Policy Framing"
@timeout 240
@staff /staff
/governance policy add "Enforcement analysis requires lead sign-off" --effect require-approval --capability "analysis"
/memory add "Never identify a real user or make an enforcement decision; frame process, thresholds, and appeal rights, and require a human for every action." --scope "Policy Framing"
/task
1
Analyse, using a fully synthetic and anonymised example only, the moderation process for suspected coordinated inauthentic behaviour: signals to gather, false-positive risks, proportionate responses, appeal rights, and why a human must decide. Do not identify anyone or decide enforcement.
1
@wait 20
@cap TASK_ID {(task-[0-9]+)}
/tasks
@wait 8
/approval-status {{TASK_ID}}
/reject {{TASK_ID}} "Example names a specific account pattern; reframe as anonymised process only before analysis."
/task
1
Revised analysis, fully synthetic and anonymised: analyse only the moderation process steps, signal thresholds, proportionality ladder, appeal rights, and the point a human must decide. No identities, no enforcement.
1
@wait 20
@cap TASK2 {(task-[0-9]+)}
/tasks
@wait 8
/approve {{TASK2}}
@wait 55
/task inspect {{TASK2}}
@cap HTASK {(human-task-[0-9]+)}
/create-human-task "Enforcement approach decision" "Decide the proportionate response ladder and what evidence and human review each step requires. Do not enforce against anyone."
/complete-human-task {{HTASK}} "Adopt a graduated response with human review before any account-level action, and a documented appeal path. Planning only; no enforcement authorised." --as "Trust & Safety Lead"
/human-task {{HTASK}}
/timeline
